msgid "Stare"
msgstr "Mirar fijamente"

msgid "Stare passionately"
msgstr "Mirar con pasión"

msgid "Stare calmly"
msgstr "Mirar con calma"

msgid "Stare blankly"
msgstr "Mirar distraído"

msgid "About Kushieda"
msgstr "Sobre Kushieda"

msgid "Don't be so stubborn!"
msgstr "¡No seas tan terca!"

msgid "You've always been there to confront me!"
msgstr "¡Siempre estuviste ahí para enfrentarme!"

msgid "About Taiga"
msgstr "Sobre Taiga"

msgid "Don't coddle Taiga!"
msgstr "¡No consientas a Taiga!"

msgid "Even I can't bear to leave her alone!"
msgstr "¡Ni yo puedo soportar dejarla sola!"

msgid "About the Past"
msgstr "Sobre el pasado"

msgid "I won't just pretend nothing happened!"
msgstr "¡No fingiré que no pasó nada!"

msgid "Did you come back just to silence me!?"
msgstr "¡¿Volviste solo para callarme?!"

msgid "Even Taiga's old man......!"
msgstr "¡Hasta el padre de Taiga......!"

msgid "About Me"
msgstr "Sobre mí"

msgid "Got the wrong idea about me and Taiga!?"
msgstr "¡¿Malinterpretaste lo mío con Taiga?!"

msgid "Did you reject me so I'd get with Taiga!?"
msgstr "¡¿Me rechazaste para que estuviera con Taiga?!"

msgid "Don't take advantage of my amnesia!"
msgstr "¡No te aproveches de mi amnesia!"

msgid "I Wanted to Say"
msgstr "Quería decir"

msgid "You're......!"
msgstr "¡Tú eres......!"

msgid "I'm......!"
msgstr "¡Yo soy......!"

msgid "I've......"
msgstr "Yo he......"

msgid "About Kushieda"
msgstr "Sobre Kushieda"

msgid "Don't be so stubborn!"
msgstr "¡No seas tan terca!"

msgid "You've always been there to confront me!"
msgstr "¡Siempre estuviste ahí para enfrentarme!"

msgid "You're the one who should be independent!"
msgstr "¡Tú eres quien debería ser independiente!"

msgid "About Taiga"
msgstr "Sobre Taiga"

msgid "Don't coddle Taiga!"
msgstr "¡No consientas a Taiga!"

msgid "Even I can't bear to leave her alone!"
msgstr "¡Ni yo puedo soportar dejarla sola!"

msgid "Don't use Taiga as an excuse!"
msgstr "¡No uses a Taiga como excusa!"

msgid "--A Serious Talk with Minori!--"
msgstr "--¡Una charla seria con Minori!--"

msgid "Minori「Are you doing that to put pressure on＿me!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿Lo haces para presionarme?!」"

msgid "Minori「......Think this is a joke?」"
msgstr "Minori「......¿Crees que es una broma?」"

msgid "Minori「Don't challenge me!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡No me desafíes!!」"

msgid "Minori「If you're not going to try, then I wish I＿had gone home.」"
msgstr "Minori「Si no vas a intentarlo, ojalá＿me hubiera ido a casa.」"

msgid "Minori「......Are you done?」"
msgstr "Minori「......¿Ya terminaste?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Not even close!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ni de cerca!」"

msgid "Minori「What? Is that all you've got?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué? ¿Eso es todo lo que tienes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not done with you yet!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Aún no termino contigo!」"

msgid "Minori「Want to put an end to this!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿Quieres terminar con esto?!」"

msgid "Minori「............」"
msgstr "Minori「............」"

msgid "Minori「......」"
msgstr "Minori「......」"

msgid "Minori「Think what you want.」"
msgstr "Minori「Piensa lo que quieras.」"

msgid "Minori「What's wrong with thinking of Taiga!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿Qué tiene de malo pensar en Taiga?!」"

msgid "Minori「I'll get you back for that.」"
msgstr "Minori「Me las vas a pagar por eso.」"

msgid "Minori「That's not it! Why won't you just＿understand?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡No es eso! ¿Por qué simplemente＿no lo entiendes?」"

msgid "Minori「So what?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Y qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I never thought you'd be prejudiced!＿What's going on!? Why are you so＿actively biased against Taiga!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Nunca pensé que tuvieras prejuicios!＿¡¿Qué pasa?! ¡¿Por qué estás tan＿predispuesta contra Taiga?!」"

msgid "Minori「Am I?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Lo estoy?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, you are!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Sí, lo estás!」"

msgid "Minori「Then I'm fine with that.」"
msgstr "Minori「Entonces me parece bien.」"

msgid "Minori「What does that have to do with this!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿Qué tiene que ver eso con esto?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Plenty! Why are you of all people trying＿to go against Taiga's wishes!? Won't＿you see her for who she is!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Mucho! ¡¿Por qué precisamente tú＿intentas ir contra los deseos de Taiga?!＿¡¿No puedes verla como realmente es?!」"

msgid "Minori「I do see her!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Sí la veo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No you don't!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No la ves!」"

msgid "Minori「Don't jump to your own conclusions!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡No saques tus propias conclusiones!」"

msgid "Minori「I don't remember that.」"
msgstr "Minori「No recuerdo eso.」"

msgid "Minori「I've put it behind me.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya lo dejé atrás.」"

msgid "Minori「What are you talking about? Where'd＿you hear that? From who?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿De qué estás hablando? ¿Dónde＿escuchaste eso? ¿De quién?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You say you put Taiga first, but you're＿using that as an escape route! You're＿dependent on Taiga!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Dices que pones a Taiga primero,＿¡pero usas eso como vía de escape!＿¡Dependes de Taiga!」"

msgid "Minori「On Taiga?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿De Taiga?」"

msgid "Minori「............」"
msgstr "Minori「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't you understand just how cruel of＿you that is!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿No entiendes lo cruel que＿es eso de tu parte?!」"

msgid "Minori「If it's for Taiga's sake, then I don't＿consider it coddling.」"
msgstr "Minori「Si es por el bien de Taiga, no considero＿que sea consentirla.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Like I said, it's not for her sake!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Como dije, no es por su bien!」"

msgid "Minori「Well, I'm not so sure.」"
msgstr "Minori「Bueno, no estoy tan segura.」"

msgid "Minori「Talk about the pot calling the kettle＿black! How dare you say that!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Mira quién habla! ¡Cómo＿te atreves a decir eso!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I've stopped!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ya dejé de hacerlo!」"

msgid "Minori「Yeah, right! That's impossible for you!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Sí, claro! ¡Eso es imposible para ti!」"

msgid "Minori「I'm not.」"
msgstr "Minori「No lo soy.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You are!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Sí lo eres!」"

msgid "Minori「I'm NOT!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Que NO lo soy!」"

msgid "Minori「It's so sad you think that way.」"
msgstr "Minori「Es muy triste que pienses así.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then what is it!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Entonces qué es?!」"

msgid "Minori「That's what I want you to think about.」"
msgstr "Minori「Eso es en lo que quiero que pienses.」"

msgid "Minori「That was obvious from the start.」"
msgstr "Minori「Eso era obvio desde el principio.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「In that case, do you get what it is I'm＿trying to say!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En ese caso, ¡¿entiendes lo que＿estoy tratando de decir?!」"

msgid "Minori「Right back at you.」"
msgstr "Minori「Lo mismo te digo.」"

msgid "Minori「So you're saying I should endure it?＿Don't make me laugh!」"
msgstr "Minori「¿O sea que debería aguantarlo?＿¡No me hagas reír!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's wrong with that!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué tiene de malo eso?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Fuck you......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Jódete......!」"

msgid "Minori「I know.」"
msgstr "Minori「Lo sé.」"

msgid "Minori「It goes without saying.」"
msgstr "Minori「No hace falta decirlo.」"

msgid "Minori「An excuse!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿Una excusa?!」"

msgid "Minori「Where's the excuse in that!? What part＿of that is wrong!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿Dónde está la excusa en eso?!＿¡¿Qué parte de eso está mal?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nothing you're saying sounds like you!＿What have you done with Kushieda＿Minori!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No suenas para nada como tú! ¡¿Qué＿hiciste con Kushieda Minori?!」"

msgid "Minori「I'm right here! Right in front of Takasu＿Ryuuji!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Estoy justo aquí! ¡Justo＿frente a Takasu Ryuuji!」"

msgid "Minori「That's not true!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Eso no es cierto!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You do when you talk about \"Taiga\" or＿\"Takasu-kun\"! It's proof that you don't＿want to get hurt!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Sí lo haces cuando hablas de \"Taiga\"＿o \"Takasu-kun\"! ¡Es prueba de que＿no quieres salir lastimada!」"

msgid "Minori「Wha......!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿Qué......?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's natural for the fist that lashes out＿to feel pain! Even fists can get bloody!＿Am I wrong!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Es normal que el puño que golpea＿sienta dolor! ¡Hasta los puños sangran!＿¡¿Acaso me equivoco?!」"

msgid "Minori「......」"
msgstr "Minori「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「LISTEN! Kushieda Minori!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡ESCUCHA, Kushieda Minori!」"

msgid "Minori「Takasu-kun, all I hear is that you just＿don't want to do it.」"
msgstr "Minori「Takasu-kun, solo oigo que simplemente＿no quieres hacerlo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You trying to say it's my problem!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Intentas decir que es problema mío?!」"

msgid "Minori「Exactly.」"
msgstr "Minori「Exacto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha......!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué......?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm saying I CAN'T!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Digo que NO PUEDO!」"

msgid "Minori「Then you're just wasting your breath! I＿don't give a fuck!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Entonces pierdes el tiempo!＿¡Me importa una mierda!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What'd you say!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué dijiste?!」"

msgid "Minori「You will.」"
msgstr "Minori「Lo harás.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I won't!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No lo haré!」"

msgid "Minori「Just do it!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Solo hazlo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I said, I WON'T!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Dije que NO lo haré!」"

msgid "Minori「That depends on you.」"
msgstr "Minori「Eso depende de ti.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then don't go out of your way!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Entonces no te molestes en hacerlo!」"

msgid "Minori「......Yeah.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Sí.」"

msgid "Minori「Is that what you think?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Eso es lo que piensas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Answer the question!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Responde la pregunta!」"

msgid "Minori「I don't feel like it.」"
msgstr "Minori「No tengo ganas.」"

msgid "Minori「Go ahead and think what you want!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Adelante, piensa lo que quieras!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「If I'm wrong, then say something!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Si me equivoco, entonces di algo!」"

msgid "Minori「It doesn't matter!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡No importa!!」"

msgid "Minori「Feel free to think that.」"
msgstr "Minori「Eres libre de pensar eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「If I'm wrong, then say something!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Si me equivoco, entonces di algo!」"

msgid "Minori「There's nothing much to say.」"
msgstr "Minori「No hay mucho que decir.」"

msgid "Minori「......What's wrong with that?」"
msgstr "Minori「......¿Qué tiene de malo eso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's not an answer!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Eso no es una respuesta!」"

msgid "Minori「I don't feel like answering.」"
msgstr "Minori「No tengo ganas de responder.」"

msgid "Minori「What the hell!? Beating a dead horse,＿are you!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿Qué diablos?! ¡¿Vas a seguir＿insistiendo en lo mismo?!」"

msgid "Minori「So!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿Y qué?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So you let me think that you believed＿that Taiga was the one trying to keep＿you away from her house! Am I wrong!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Me dejaste pensar que creías que＿Taiga era quien quería alejarte de＿su casa! ¡¿Acaso me equivoco?!」"

msgid "Minori「So what!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿Y qué?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't change the subject! We're talking＿about YOU!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No cambies de tema! ¡Hablamos de TI!」"

msgid "Minori「If you don't feel like listening to me,＿then don't bring it up in the first place!」"
msgstr "Minori「Si no quieres oírme, ¡entonces ni＿saques el tema para empezar!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're the one that doesn't feel like＿listening!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Tú eres quien no tiene＿ganas de escuchar!」"

msgid "Minori「I won't take part in this stupid＿argument!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡No voy a participar en esta＿estúpida discusión!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Me either!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Yo tampoco!」"

msgid "Minori「......」"
msgstr "Minori「......」"

msgid "Minori「Even if I did have the wrong idea,＿would it really hurt anything?」"
msgstr "Minori「Aunque me hubiera hecho una idea＿equivocada, ¿en qué afectaría?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It would hurt Taiga, at the least!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡Al menos lastimaría a Taiga!!」"

msgid "Minori「I'm not so sure about that.」"
msgstr "Minori「No estoy tan segura de eso.」"

msgid "Minori「She's the one who doesn't understand!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ella es quien no lo entiende!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Excuse me!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Disculpa?!」"

msgid "Minori「Takasu-kun, it's your own problem. I＿don't give a rat's ass!」"
msgstr "Minori「Takasu-kun, es tu problema.＿¡Me importa un carajo!」"

msgid "Minori「I don't think it's the wrong idea,＿though.」"
msgstr "Minori「Aunque no creo que sea＿una idea equivocada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, it is!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Pues lo es!」"

msgid "Minori「......Fine, I give up. You're ridiculous.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Bien, me rindo. Eres ridículo.」"

msgid "Minori「So you say......」"
msgstr "Minori「Eso dices tú......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's that supposed to mean!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué se supone que significa eso?!」"

msgid "Minori「Nothing.」"
msgstr "Minori「Nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't dodge the question!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No evadas la pregunta!」"

msgid "Minori「I don't know.」"
msgstr "Minori「No lo sé.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Good lord!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡Por Dios!」"

msgid "Minori「I don't give a flying fuck!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Me importa una maldita mierda!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「This is about you!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Esto se trata de ti!」"

msgid "Minori「Think what you want, Takasu-kun! But＿if you get Taiga to think that, I'll be＿pissed!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Piensa lo que quieras, Takasu-kun!＿Pero si haces que Taiga piense＿eso, ¡me voy a enojar!」"

msgid "Minori「If you try to push Taiga away because＿of that, I won't forgive you! I won't＿EVER forgive you!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Si intentas alejar a Taiga por＿eso, no te lo perdonaré! ¡¡No＿te lo perdonaré JAMÁS!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why would you get that idea!? Answer＿the question!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Por qué tendrías esa idea?!＿¡Responde la pregunta!」"

msgid "Minori「I don't care! I don't CARE what you＿think of me!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡No me importa! ¡No me IMPORTA＿lo que pienses de mí!」"

msgid "Minori「Feel free to think that.」"
msgstr "Minori「Eres libre de pensar eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's that supposed to mean!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué se supone que significa eso?!」"

msgid "Minori「I mean, even if you thought that, it＿wouldn't drive you to do anything.」"
msgstr "Minori「Quiero decir que, aunque pensaras eso,＿no te llevaría a hacer nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't understand what you're saying!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No entiendo lo que dices!」"

msgid "Minori「You don't have to understand. No big＿deal.」"
msgstr "Minori「No tienes que entenderlo.＿No es gran cosa.」"

msgid "Minori「......That's enough.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Ya es suficiente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's your problem!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Cuál es tu problema?!」"

msgid "Minori「I didn't mean anything in particular.」"
msgstr "Minori「No quise decir nada en especial.」"

msgid "Minori「I'd do anything for Taiga! That's who I＿am! Got a problem with that!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Haría lo que fuera por Taiga!＿¡Así soy yo! ¡¿Tienes algún＿problema con eso?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So you don't give a fuck about me!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Entonces yo te importo una mierda?!」"

msgid "Minori「When did I say that!? But go ahead and＿think that if you like! No big deal for＿me!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿Cuándo dije eso?! ¡Adelante,＿piénsalo si quieres! ¡Para＿mí no es gran cosa!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's that supposed to mean!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué se supone que significa eso?!」"

msgid "Minori「I mean I don't take issue with Taiga or＿you!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Digo que no tengo problemas＿ni con Taiga ni contigo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「We're talking about YOU!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Estamos hablando de TI!」"

msgid "Minori「That's unrelated!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Eso no tiene nada que ver!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're going to end this with that!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Vas a terminar esto así?!」"

msgid "Minori「That's my answer! Got a problem!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Esa es mi respuesta! ¡¿Algún problema?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You clearly have no intention of＿answering me seriously!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Claramente no tienes intención＿de responderme en serio!」"

msgid "Minori「Like I said, that's fine by me!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Como dije, por mí está bien!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Y-You bitch......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡M-Maldita......!」"

msgid "Minori「......」"
msgstr "Minori「......」"

msgid "Minori「You intend to keep talking this late in＿the game? Give up already!」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Piensas seguir hablando a estas＿alturas? ¡Ríndete de una vez!」"

msgid "Minori「I told you not to say that! Don't fuck＿with me!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Te dije que no dijeras＿eso! ¡¡No me jodas!!」"

msgid "Minori「Don't say it.」"
msgstr "Minori「No lo digas.」"

msgid "Minori「Stop!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Detente!」"

msgid "Minori「There's no point in saying it now. And I＿don't want to hear it.」"
msgstr "Minori「No tiene caso decirlo ahora.＿Y no quiero escucharlo.」"

msgid "Minori「Don't force me to listen to that!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡No me obligues a escuchar eso!!」"

msgid "Minori「I don't wanna hear it.」"
msgstr "Minori「No quiero escucharlo.」"

msgid "Minori「I'm not listening.」"
msgstr "Minori「No te escucho.」"

msgid "Minori「AAARRRRGGGHHHH!! Quit FUCKING＿WITH ME! Takasu-kun, do you seriously＿want to talk about that right now!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡AAARRRRGGGHHHH!! ¡Deja de JODERME!＿Takasu-kun, ¡¿en serio quieres hablar＿de eso ahora mismo?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then listen to what I have to say!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Entonces escucha lo que voy a decir!」"

msgid "Minori「I AM listening! So don't just blurt out＿the same things over and over!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡SÍ te escucho! ¡Así que no sueltes＿lo mismo una y otra vez!」"

