msgid "Ryuuji「Is it hard to watch? Of course it is! It＿hurts! But, if you're her best friend,＿you have to endure it and stay out of」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Es duro verlo? ¡Claro que sí!＿¡Duele! Pero, si eres su mejor amiga,＿¡debes aguantar y no meterte en」"

msgid "Ryuuji「it! You have to accept it!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「eso! ¡Tienes que aceptarlo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Listen, Kushieda! By refusing to accept＿it, you're treating it like it doesn't exist!＿It's like Taiga's efforts and feelings」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Escucha, Kushieda! ¡Si no lo aceptas,＿actúas como si no existiera! ¡Como si＿los esfuerzos y sentimientos de Taiga」"

msgid "Ryuuji「don't exist!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「no existieran!」"

msgid "Minori「You and I have two different＿standpoints! By the way, you definitely＿won't be able to leave her alone!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Tú y yo tenemos dos posturas distintas!＿Por cierto, ¡definitivamente no vas＿a poder dejarla sola!」"

msgid "Minori「Definitely!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Definitivamente!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, that's right! That's all I've heard＿out of you! Taiga this! Taiga that! Oh,＿and nothing but telling me who I am」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Sí, así es! ¡Es todo lo que te he＿oído! ¡Taiga esto! ¡Taiga aquello!＿¡Ah, y solo me dices quién soy」"

msgid "Ryuuji「and what to do!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「y qué hacer!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, your true feelings aren't! Behind＿that wall you've built yourself, in that＿little world no one else can touch, you」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Pues tus verdaderos sentimientos no!＿¡Tras ese muro que tú levantaste, en＿ese mundito que nadie más toca, tú」"

msgid "Ryuuji「never commit to anything!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「nunca te comprometes con nada!」"

msgid "Minori「It's not a matter of will or won't. It's a＿matter of can or can't! If it's for Taiga's＿sake, I can! And you should be able to」"
msgstr "Minori「No es cuestión de querer, ¡sino＿de poder! ¡Por Taiga, yo puedo!＿¡Y tú deberías poder hacerlo」"

msgid "Minori「as well!」"
msgstr "Minori「también!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You said it yourself, didn't you? The＿reason Taiga doesn't tell you about her＿personal life is because her dad」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tú lo dijiste, ¿no? ¡La razón＿por la que Taiga no te cuenta＿su vida personal es que su padre」"

msgid "Ryuuji「upsets you!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「te molesta!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But you were the one pushing Taiga＿away! That's why you wouldn't set foot＿in her house! In the end, you're just a」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Pero tú eras quien alejaba a Taiga!＿¡Por eso no entrabas en su casa!＿Al final, ¡no eres más que una」"

msgid "Ryuuji「fair-weather friend!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「amiga solo en las buenas!」"

msgid "Minori「Oh fuck you!! Don't you understand＿how Taiga feels!? If you do, then why,＿why, WHY would you bring up that」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡Oh, jódete!! ¡¿No entiendes cómo＿se siente Taiga?! Si lo sabes, ¡¿por＿qué, por qué, POR QUÉ hablas de ese」"

msgid "Minori「deadbeat dad!?」"
msgstr "Minori「bueno para nada de su padre?!」"
